('a2', 'e1', 'Holiday roster — pick your preferences', 'The holiday scheduling window is open. Add your availability and time-off preferences by Friday and I’ll do my best to accommodate everyone.', '2026-07-04T21:56:14.356Z', false, 'Flagship · Marina'),
